Setup:
1. Manually install packages listed below.
2. Use GNU stow to create dotfile symlinks for each subdirectory in this repo (e.g. `stow nvim`).
3. Open nvim and run :PlugInstall to install plugins

Minimum packages to install:
1. GNU Stow
2. Zsh
3. Zsh Spaceship prompt and required fonts (enable in local .zshrc)
4. Ripgrep
5. FZF
6. Neovim
7. Vim-Plug
